{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lock and load, soldier\u2014it's time to bring the pain (or, you know, the sneaky silent takedowns). <strong>Gunslugs : Rogue Tactics</strong> throws you into a chaotic, ever-changing battlefield straight out of an '80s action flick, complete with explosions, one-liners, and the freedom to play your way.   </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1012360/extras/b0f36402c937a332b073fd7acd3357e8.poster.avif?t=1772453357\" width=600 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1012360/extras/b0f36402c937a332b073fd7acd3357e8.webm?t=1772453357\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1012360/extras/b0f36402c937a332b073fd7acd3357e8.mp4?t=1772453357\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stealthy and precise? Avoid cameras, hide in the shadows, and take down enemies one by one like a tactical mastermind. Prefer the classic <i>spray-and-pray</i> method? Grab your biggest gun, kick down the door, and start blasting\u2014because sometimes, the only stealth you need is making sure no one\u2019s left standing.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1012360/extras/9f5499cfb67c4a0680db7a087535a4ba.poster.avif?t=1772453357\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1012360/extras/9f5499cfb67c4a0680db7a087535a4ba.webm?t=1772453357\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1012360/extras/9f5499cfb67c4a0680db7a087535a4ba.mp4?t=1772453357\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With procedurally generated levels, no two missions are ever the same. Each failure is just another excuse to blow more stuff up, try a new strategy, or equip a pair of fast shoes and just outrun your problems. From tossing tennis balls to distract guards to setting off a perfectly placed minefield, every encounter is a puzzle\u2026 or a fireworks show, depending on your style.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >So, what\u2019s it gonna be? Careful infiltration or total carnage? Either way, get to the chopper\u2014or at least try to!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1012360/extras/fef2fcc9e8196d477a7c9a9c0f03a896.poster.avif?t=1772453357\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1012360/extras/fef2fcc9e8196d477a7c9a9c0f03a896.webm?t=1772453357\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1012360/extras/fef2fcc9e8196d477a7c9a9c0f03a896.mp4?t=1772453357\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Stealth or Mayhem?</strong> \u2013 Sneak like a shadow\u2026 or go in like an unstoppable action hero.  </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Mission Variety</strong> \u2013 Every run throws new objectives your way.  </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Tactical Shenanigans</strong> \u2013 Distract enemies with rocks, set traps, or just dropkick them into oblivion.  </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Loot, Baby!</strong> \u2013 Stock up on shields, EMPs, helmets, and ridiculous weaponry.  </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Ever-Changing Battlefields</strong> \u2013 Procedurally generated levels mean no two missions play the same.  </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Big Explosions</strong> \u2013 Because what\u2019s an action game without some good ol\u2019 cinematic BOOM?  </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No two runs. No boring moments. Just non-stop, action-packed, tactical mayhem. You in?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1012360/extras/e26c06acad9095f7bb3c5dae87465f40.avif?t=1772453357\" width=612 height=200 /></span></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"icon":"35968e00c4af823ecd4deab09ef4d5db3e79137a.jpg","localized_name":"Urban Specialist","name":"Urban Specialist","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1012360/35968e00c4af823ecd4deab09ef4d5db3e79137a.jpg"},{"icon":"2a4aedfdde996612991f6dbc297b351a10c8a92e.jpg","localized_name":"Jungle Rat","name":"Jungle Rat","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1012360/2a4aedfdde996612991f6dbc297b351a10c8a92e.jpg"},{"icon":"46ef77038ca71278949f085db653c59caf5a7ddc.jpg","localized_name":"Cold Cat","name":"Cold Cat","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1012360/46ef77038ca71278949f085db653c59caf5a7ddc.jpg"},{"icon":"d842c985cc9cf963e6c7c8c7a5aa17379ebb8eb1.jpg","localized_name":"Sand Worm","name":"Sand Worm","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1012360/d842c985cc9cf963e6c7c8c7a5aa17379ebb8eb1.jpg"},{"icon":"0fed57648618a21699473858d10127c6ce6db2f4.jpg","localized_name":"Galaxy Warrior","name":"Galaxy Warrior","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1012360/0fed57648618a21699473858d10127c6ce6db2f4.jpg"},{"icon":"654486cbc3411dd20