 into oblivion.  </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Loot, Baby!</strong> \u2013 Stock up on shields, EMPs, helmets, and ridiculous weaponry.  </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Ever-Changing Battlefields</strong> \u2013 Procedurally generated levels mean no two missions play the same.  </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Big Explosions</strong> \u2013 Because what\u2019s an action game without some good ol\u2019 cinematic BOOM?  </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No two runs. No boring moments. Just non-stop, action-packed, tactical mayhem. You in?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1012360/extras/e26c06acad9095f7bb3c5dae87465f40.avif?t=1772453357\" width=612 height=200 /></span></p>","developers":["Orangepixel"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1012360/header.jpg?t=1772453357","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"Copyright (c) OrangePixel - www.orangepixel.net","linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Ubuntu 12<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> 2.0 ghz Dual Core<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 2 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Intel HD3000 or higher with OpenGL 2.1 support<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 200 MB available space<br></li><li><strong>Sound Card:</strong> OpenAL supported sound card</li></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> OSX Lion or newer<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> 2.0 ghz Dual Core<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 2 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Intel HD3000 or higher with